    'Desert Recreation District offers a weekly Adaptive Pickleball class at Palm Desert Civic Center Park with drills that build toward game play, and sport chairs are available for seated players. The program is designed for individuals with disabilities and special needs age 10 and up, standing or sitting.', 'unverified', 'active', 1, 'ASNM research 2026-10-26', strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ','now'), strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ','now')
  WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM organizations WHERE website_url = 'https://www.myrecreationdistrict.com/adaptive-therapeutic-sports-recreation' OR (name = 'Desert Recreation District Adaptive Pickleball' COLLATE NOCASE AND state = 'CA'));

