    'The City of Torrance Adaptive Sports Program is a year round program with weekly practices and competitions, and pickleball clinics are one of its offered sports. It serves teens and adults age 12 and older with intellectual disabilities.', 'unverified', 'active', 1, 'ASNM research 2026-10-26', strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ','now'), strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ','now')
